    {
        "Id": 4,
        "ActionId": 4,
        "Type": 301,
        "BeginAnim": "DialogEnable",
        "Params": [
            1,
            "",
            "The memories flood into Lee's brain all at once."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 5,
        "ActionId": 5,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "He realizes that this is his M.I.N.D. It is a M.I.N.D. that has recorded all failures and deaths, the M.I.N.D. of all the \"Lees\" in the past and the future fighting different possibilities."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 6,
        "ActionId": 6,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Due to some unknown reason, they have all intertwined and connected here, creating this dimension of chaos in front of him."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 7,
        "ActionId": 7,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "He finally understands, the M.I.N.D. overload while adapting his frame and those fleeting flashes of memories—it was all because of this."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 8,
        "ActionId": 8,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "The existence of this place serves only one purpose, and that is to block all \"his\" future memories out."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 9,
        "ActionId": 9,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "All the messages sent into the past were to lead him to that one future, and now that he is in the future, he has blocked out all memories related to the actions of sending and receiving those messages."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 10,
        "ActionId": 10,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Only leaving some \"coincidental\" hints to guide him here."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 11,
        "ActionId": 11,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "When numerous Lees were fighting for their desired future, there was one Lee who was dragging all the Lees who had broken down in this infinite loop of madness into this M.I.N.D., and destroying them himself in order to not cause a butterfly effect due to small changes."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 12,
        "ActionId": 12,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "In that moment, he sees all the possible pasts and futures through these memories, all is clearly displayed in front of him."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 13,
        "ActionId": 13,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "His M.I.N.D. should not have been able to load such an enormous amount of information, but right here, right now, with the help of his other selves, he can utilize the computing power of \"himself\" in all universes."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 14,
        "ActionId": 14,
        "Type": 301,
        "EndAnim": "AniZhuanchangBegin",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "And in that moment, he remembers all the blocked and redacted memories."
        ]
    },
