        "BeginAnim": "DialogEnable",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "One was from when machines littered the skies and the ground. There was no more greenery on the planet, only metal and scorched earth."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 34,
        "ActionId": 34,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Gray Raven was still Gray Raven, but they could not save their commandant, nor could they retrieve the body afterward."
        ]
