    {
        "Id": 35,
        "ActionId": 35,
        "Type": 301,
        "EndAnim": "AniZhuanchangBegin",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "He had lost his mobility, there was nothing he could do when his dear teammates left to lead the fight away but cry for them at the top of his lungs. His cries were never answered."
