        "Id": 66,
        "ActionId": 65,
        "Type": 301,
        "BeginAnim": "DialogEnable",
        "Params": [
            1,
            "",
            "Strings and strings of data appear around him, forming complete and fragmented figures. Numerous \"Lees\" from different universes materialize in front of him and observe him with different expressions."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 67,
        "ActionId": 66,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Lee (?)",
            "...I wanted to change the past, but it led to an even bigger catastrophe.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 68,
        "ActionId": 67,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Lee (?)",
            "In the end... I forgot what I was fighting for and trying to save.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 69,
        "ActionId": 68,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Lee (?)",
            "You can't save everyone.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 70,
        "ActionId": 69,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Lee (?)",
            "This is my advice for you.",
            3
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 71,
        "ActionId": 70,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Lee (?)",
            "Don't fixate on the unchangeable past. Don't try to change the past that has already happened before you entered the \"tower.\"",
            3
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 72,
        "ActionId": 71,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Lee (?)",
            "Try to find the future that became a possibility when you stepped foot inside.",
            3
