    {
        "Id": 77,
        "ActionId": 76,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Lee clenches his fists, his gaze as determined as ever, as if he has never failed before."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 78,
        "ActionId": 77,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Even though all these memories are fusing into one in his M.I.N.D., and all the sorrow, hatred, and regrets are becoming a part of him—"
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 79,
        "ActionId": 78,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "He does not feel despair, because he knows that his universe is filled with possibilities. The destined future is indeed changing thanks to the hard work of all the others."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 80,
        "ActionId": 79,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Amidst the flow of all these memories, he is able to catch the key message hidden in the core of the \"tower,\" and it originates from the last record of the perished \"Lees\"."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 81,
        "ActionId": 80,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "They turned their own memories into a beacon, guiding him on his journey."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 82,
        "ActionId": 81,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "What all these \"Lees\" want to convey to him is not how many times they have tried to change the depressing past, but that no matter how hopeless the future seems, there is always one of \"him\" who keeps marching forward undeterred."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 83,
        "ActionId": 82,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "No matter how many battles he has to fight, he still perseveres in the infinite futures."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 84,
        "ActionId": 83,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Lee looks at each and every version of himself in this unique M.I.N.D. Each one is covered in scars from battles with time."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 85,
        "ActionId": 84,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Some versions of himself are battered to the point that they are nearly unrecognizable, but there is one thing they all have in common."
